+# Bulletproof React - project notes
+
+Bulletproof React is a reference architecture for React apps. The working app is `apps/react-vite` (React, Vite, TanStack Query, Zod, Tailwind). The Next.js apps are not part of this work.
+
+Comments on discussions can be created, deleted by an admin or the author, and now edited by their author.
+
+- [[sessions/2026-11-02]] - added comment editing (PATCH /comments/{commentId}, Edit drawer, success notification)
