+# 2026-11-02
+
+## Done
+
+- Added `useUpdateComment` and `updateComment` (PATCH `/comments/{commentId}` with `{ body }`) in `features/comments/api/update-comment.ts`.
+- The success notification ("Comment Updated") is raised in that hook's `onSuccess`, per the project rule.
+- Added `UpdateComment` drawer (Edit button) in `features/comments/components/update-comment.tsx`, rendered in `comments-list.tsx` only when `POLICIES['comment:update']` passes.
+- Added the `comment:update` policy in `lib/authorization.tsx`: the author only, including admins.
+- Added a PATCH mock handler in `testing/mocks/handlers/comments.ts` (404 when missing, 403 when the caller is not the author).
+
+## Not done
+
+- Tests and lint were not run, as requested.
+- No unit or E2E test was added for the edit flow.
+
+## Next
+
+- Add an integration test for editing an own comment and for the missing Edit button on others' comments.
+- Existing delete and update components call `addNotification` in the component, which breaks the project rule. Leave as is unless asked.
